  "description": "Two steel blades meet edge to edge in a stone courtyard. 0 ms: the attacker's blade (a long bar, 640 Hz) strikes near its tip. 4 ms later the defender's blade, shorter and held tight so it rings higher and dies sooner, answers. Both are real hand-forged bars, a little out of true. 30 to 260 ms: the edges grind along each other as the swords slide to the guards, a rasp that slows down. A few sparks tick off the contact. Walls give it a short hard slap.",
